          "snippet": {
            "text": "/-- **`T₂(S) = a(n) − a(⌊n/2⌋)/2 + (c(n) − c(⌊n/2⌋))/S`** for `S ∈ [n, n+1)`. -/\ntheorem T2_eq_ac {n : ℕ} (hn : 1 ≤ n) {S : ℝ} (h1 : (n : ℝ) ≤ S) (h2 : S < n + 1) :\n    T2 S = areal n - areal (n / 2) / 2 + (creal n - creal (n / 2)) / S := by",
