            ],
            "conclusion": "For $S\\in[n,n+1)$, $n\\ge1$: `T2 S = areal n - areal (n/2)/2 + (creal n - creal (n/2))/S`, i.e. $T_2(S)=\\alpha_n+\\beta_n/S$ exactly with $\\alpha_n,\\beta_n$ depending only on $\\lfloor S\\rfloor$."
